00:32:15.940 --> 00:32:16.600
<v Ira Glass>Really?
<v Ira Glass>是的。比如有16个女性写了史诗级的生理期失败经历。

00:32:16.600 --> 00:32:20.990
<v Elna Baker>Yeah. Like, there were 16 women who wrote in with epic period fails.
<v Elna Baker>不过我得说，那是可以预料到的。

00:32:20.990 --> 00:32:23.330
<v Ira Glass>Though I have to say, that's one you could kind of anticipate.
<v Ira Glass>但你肯定预料不到有三个人错误地导致了拆弹小组出动。

00:32:23.330 --> 00:32:31.460
<v Elna Baker>Yeah, but you couldn't anticipate that three people were mistakenly the reason that a bomb squad got called in.
<v Elna Baker>OK，是的，这确实想不到。

