00:33:15.670 --> 00:33:19.570
<v Ira Glass>I will say that both of those are so basic.
<v Ira Glass>我觉得人们感到尴尬的事情，都是小时候被告知“不要做”的事情。比如——

00:33:19.570 --> 00:33:25.790
<v Elna Baker>I think that people get embarrassed by the things that you were told not to do when you were a kid. Like--
<v Elna Baker>不要裸体。

