<v Ira Glass>Don't be naked.
<v Ira Glass>不要裸体。

00:33:26.540 --> 00:33:27.290
<v Elna Baker>Don't be naked.
<v Elna Baker>去洗手间。

00:33:27.290 --> 00:33:27.850
<v Ira Glass>Use the bathroom.
<v Ira Glass>完全正确。

00:33:27.850 --> 00:33:28.530
<v Elna Baker>Exactly.
<v Elna Baker>这些是最大的类别。剩下的又怎么分类呢？

00:33:28.530 --> 00:33:32.540
<v Ira Glass>And so those are the biggest categories. And then what do the rest break down into?
<v Ira Glass>一些杂七杂八的小类。在暗恋对象面前出丑，有65个人写了这个。

00:33:32.540 --> 00:33:39.440
<v Elna Baker>Little kind of like various piles. There's embarrassing yourself in front of a crush. 65 people wrote in about that.
<v Elna Baker>哇，65个人？

