<v Ira Glass>Wow, 65 people?
<v Ira Glass>是的。或者在老板或名人面前出丑，79个人。

00:33:40.730 --> 00:33:45.690
<v Elna Baker>Yep. Or embarrassing yourself in front of your boss or a celebrity, 79 people.
<v Elna Baker>嗯哼。我喜欢这两个被归在一起。继续。

00:33:45.690 --> 00:33:48.680
<v Ira Glass>Mm-hmm. I like that those two are lumped together. Keep going.
