00:33:57.260 --> 00:34:00.360
<v Ira Glass>All right, so tell me one like that, getting caught in a lie.
<v Ira Glass>OK。有个叫威尔的人。他撒谎是有非常可以理解的原因的。在中学时，他因为是海地人而被无情霸凌。

00:34:00.360 --> 00:34:07.800
<v Elna Baker>OK. So there's this guy, Will. He told a lie for very understandable reasons. In middle school, he's ruthlessly bullied for being Haitian.
<v Elna Baker>噢，天哪。

